Subject: [PATCH] Preserve MCP metadata, credentials, and recovery state

Supply the metadata field mask, route configured approval overrides through
Update, and reconcile API approval values after generated plan restoration.
Omitted approval stays unmanaged; explicit UNSPECIFIED clears the override.

Avoid calling UpdateCredentials when only metadata changes, including after an
import where C1 intentionally withholds sealed credentials. Keep the prior
state on a failed second update so Terraform can converge through the known
app and connector identifiers. Registration response loss has no safe retry:
there is no caller-supplied connector ID or idempotency key, so surface an
explicit import recovery path instead.

The handwritten mcp_server_approval.go and mcp_server_recovery.go helpers are
protected by .genignore.

